              "content": "Retrieves a document that describes services that process incoming requests, and downstream services that they call as a result. Root services process incoming requests and make calls to downstream services. Root services are applications that use the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/xray/index.html\">Amazon Web Services X-Ray SDK</a>. Downstream services can be other applications, Amazon Web Services resources, HTTP web APIs, or SQL databases.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
